pi.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/deployments","created_at":"2026-08-05T16:00:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T17:31:44Z","pushed_at":"2026-09-23T18:02:56Z","git_url":"git://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:Agent-Field/CodeAF.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF","homepage":"http://agentfield.ai/","size":196153,"stargazers_count":116,"watchers_count":116,"language":"Go","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":14,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":141,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["agent-fleet","agent-harness","agentfield","agentic-coding","ai","ai-coding","cli-agent","coding-agent","coding-agents","coding-assistant","coding-cli","coding-harness","developer-tools","harness","harness-engineering","llm","open-models","open-source-models","software-factory","terminal-agent"],"visibility":"public","forks":14,"open_issues":141,"watchers":116,"default_branch":"dev","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pulls/1032","html_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pull/1032","diff_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pull/1032.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pull/1032.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #1013.\n\n`questionOtherKey` routed keys by hand and bound a short list, so in a question's own answer box the usual text-editing keys did nothing: `cmd+←`/`cmd+→` never reached the ends of the line, `cmd+delete` never killed to the line start, and `opt+delete`/`ctrl+delete` never deleted a word — while the message box directly beneath the question answered to every one of them.\n\nThe row now reads the surface's one word-and-line vocabulary (`editorMotion` / `editorWordKill` in `internal/tui3/editkeys.go`), the same door every other box on the surface goes through, and gains the line kill's two names (`ctrl+u`, `super+backspace`). `ctrl+w` stays out on purpose: on this surface it shuts the tab in front.\n\n- `internal/tui3/question.go` — the routing; the hand-rolled chord list is gone.\n- `internal/tui3/question_test.go` — a new test walks every chord family (cmd/super/opt/ctrl + ←→, `ctrl+a`/`ctrl+e`, `ctrl+u`, cmd/opt/ctrl+delete) through the row's own box, asserts the edit is not reaching the message box, and checks the edited words still travel as the answer.\n- `internal/manual/chat/keys.md` + `questions.md` — the box is now on the list of boxes that answer the caret vocabulary (the manual law).\n\n## Checks\n\n- `go test ./internal/tui3/ -run Question` — passes.\n- Each new family was proved to bite: disabling only the motion guard, only the word kill, or only the line kill each turns the new test red, with the chord named in the failure.\n- The `pr-ready` light gate passed whole (build, vet, fmt, changelog, manual gates, laws, every package). Its heavy half (`test-touched` → `./internal/tui3`) refused to start because another session holds the box's heavy-suite lock (pid 94903); the focused `-run Question` run above is the evidence for the touched package.\n\nDrafted with [agentfield ai](https://agentfield.ai/github?utm_source=github&utm_medium=pull_request&utm_campaign=drafted_with) · reviewed and owned by the author\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1032/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1032/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]